<title>USA: St Paul hogs off $.50/1.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Paul hogs off $.50/1.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST PAUL 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts $.50 to $1.00 lower. Top $52.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>US 1-3     220-250 lbs     52.50</p>
<p>	     250-260 lbs     52.00-52.50</p>
<p>	     260-270 lbs     51.00-52.00</p>
<p>US 2-3     270-280 lbs     50.00-51.00</p>
<p>US 2-4     280-290 lbs     49.00-50.00</p>
<p>Sows: under 550 lbs steady to 1.00 lower; over 550 lbs 1.00-2.00 lower. Top 54.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3     300-400 lbs     44.00</p>
<p>	     400-500 lbs     45.00-47.50</p>
<p>	     500-550 lbs     50.00-52.00</p>
<p>	     550-700 lbs     52.00-53.00, few 54.00</p>
</text>
